In the living room in the evening, Daniel swings the glass balcony door wide open into the room as a tiny winged creature drifts softly inward over the concrete sill. Daniel, an adult man with short tousled dark brown wavy hair, a short beard and mustache, and brown eyes, wearing a green knitted wool jumper, blue denim jeans, a brown waxed-cotton jacket, and brown leather boots, stands in profile at the doorway with his fingers curled around the metal door handle, turning the door panel inward. Funkel, a palm-sized winged creature with a soft pale-gold body, cream underside, cream face, two large round dark eyes, and two thin translucent wings lifted out at shoulder height, glides past the door frame, a gentle warm gold light shining out from its entire body. Medium shot showing the honey-brown floorboards, the edge of the deep red rug, and the open doorway revealing the white balcony rail and russet autumn leaves on the balcony outside against the evening sky.

---METADATA---
