Inside a vast dark dust cloud, the white cardboard rocket drifts slowly through dense violet-grey banks of curling space dust, its single round window glowing with faint orange-gold light from within. The cardboard rocket, a tall white cylinder with a pointed nose cone, three red base fins, and the shoebox airlock fixed to its flank, spans no wider than a hand against the surrounding swirling dust lanes. Far in the dark expanse ahead, a loose row of small lamps shines as evenly spaced round points of steady, warm white light, trailing along a long diagonal line across the deep space beyond the thinning dust. Ultra-wide shot centered on the immense, dark violet and charcoal cloud with faint pale grey-blue filaments drifting throughout, the distant row of lights small and steady in the upper background.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"The cardboard rocket moves slowly inside the vast dark dust cloud while a distant diagonal row of small warm lamps shines in the deep space far ahead. Dense violet and charcoal dust banks fill the surrounding space.","characters":[],"era":"present day","weather":"none","objects":[]}

Looking down from above inside the star-dust nest, Krax's large curved silver talons clasp firmly around the white cylindrical body of the cardboard rocket, steadying it in the deep hollow of the nest. Krax, a massive star magpie of twice-adult height with silver-grey plumage, a pale silver breast, dark blue-black sheen across her wing tips and long tail, large round amber eyes, and a short rounded closed beak, stands with both feet gripping the cardboard rocket against the woven silver-grey filaments of the bowl. Warm gold light from Funkel shines through the rocket's round window, illuminating the deep bowl of the nest and the raised woven rim encircling it, while dark violet dust banks curl in the high background. High-angle shot showing the cardboard rocket held upright within the great silver-grey star-dust nest, both flat lids of the shoebox airlock closed tight on its flank.

---METADATA---
