Inside the cardboard rocket cabin, Sarah holds her silver drop earring poised at the open outer end of the shoebox airlock. Sarah, an adult woman with straight chin-length blonde hair, rectangular dark-framed glasses, and blue eyes, wearing a purple long-sleeve cotton blouse, a grey wool skirt, a yellow knitted scarf, and one small grey drop earring on her far ear, sits forward on the low cabin bench, holding the tiny silver teardrop earring delicately between her thumb and forefinger at the opening of the brown cardboard box. The inner flat lid of the shoebox airlock remains firmly closed across the top while the outer lid is lifted clear off the end. Close-up shot framed from the waist up inside the white painted cardboard cabin, showing the red trim along the wall, control dials on the forward panel, and the grey corrugated cardboard floor below.

---METADATA---
