Inside the rocket cabin, Noah presses the flat inner lid shut across the top of the shoebox airlock and lifts its outer lid open, while Emma stands beside him holding his free hand. Noah, a young school-age boy with tousled light blonde hair, bangs below his eyebrows, and blue eyes, wearing an orange fabric astronaut coverall with a grey webbing belt and a white quilted chest pack, looks affectionately at Emma, his mouth curved in a warm smile as his hand operates the cardboard lid. Emma, a preschool-age girl with wavy brown hair in a ponytail, brown eyes, freckles, and small stud earrings, wearing a white astronaut suit with a blue quilted puffer vest and red utility belt, smiles warmly as she watches Funkel, who hovers beside them near the round window, blazing with bright gold light across his whole round body and cream face, filling the cabin with a warm golden radiance. Close-up shot showing the grey corrugated floor, white cardboard walls, and the round window looking out into dark space.

