On the apartment balcony in the evening, Emma and Noah stand together with the glowing creature Funkel, every figure whole in frame, facing forward toward the viewer. Emma, a preschool-age girl with wavy brown hair in a mid-back ponytail, brown eyes, freckles, and small stud earrings, wears a white fabric astronaut flight suit, a blue quilted puffer vest, a red utility belt, and chunky white space boots, smiling warmly with her arms open. Noah, a young school-age boy with tousled ear-length light blonde hair, bangs below his eyebrows, and blue eyes, wears an orange fabric astronaut coverall with a grey webbing belt, a white quilted chest pack, and grey space boots, standing cheerfully beside her with both hands resting lightly on his belt. Funkel, a palm-sized winged creature with a soft pale-gold body, cream underside, cream face, two large round dark eyes, and two translucent wings raised out at shoulder height, hovers gently at shoulder level between them, softly glowing with warm gold light from his entire body. Wide shot of the balcony showing the grey concrete floor, the white metal railing spanning the midground, the dark green potted shrub with russet autumn leaves at the right, the open balcony door frame at the left, and the clear evening sky with distant rooftops across the background.

